maldoctrace (0.5.1-0kali1) kali-dev; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: Word altChunk imports are analysed, and Equation
    Editor exploits (CVE-2017-11882, CVE-2018-0798) are found behind
    randomized MTEF headers, case-mangled OLE streams and junk-padded RTF
    objects. See CHANGELOG.md.

